{"Guest email comparisons are case-sensitive, allowing blacklisted/existing guests to slip through with different casing": 0.9298495650291443, "Authorization check uses && requiring both admin AND owner roles, which blocks legitimate admins or owners who only have one role - should use || instead": 0.9704570174217224, "Notifications use the unfiltered guests input instead of the filtered uniqueGuests list": 0.9841654300689697, "Duplicate guest emails are not removed from the input list": 0.7616060972213745, "sendAddGuestsEmails ignores disableStandardEmails flags and forwards calendarEvent unchanged, which can send emails when they're disabled": 0.7936934232711792, "Invalid email banner remains visible even after user edits the email input to valid values - banner only clears when clicking Cancel or attempting to add again": 0.5918692946434021, "sendAddGuestsEmails can leak hidden notes to attendees by not respecting hideCalendarNotes setting": 0.16629643738269806, "Reassigning function parameter 'value' in MultiEmail component is a code smell": 0.001821090467274189, "Using array index as key in MultiEmail can cause issues when items are removed from the middle of the list": 0.42011740803718567, "Empty fragment <></> in MultiEmail can be simplified by restructuring the conditional": 0.011782495304942131}